  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ilute Solar Project - substation for ZESCO</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Serengeti Energy applied for Norad support to finance upgrading of a Zesco substation in Zambia. Serengeti Energy as major shareholder in Ilute Solar Limited - the project company - is developing the Ilute Solar PV project in Zambia and the national utility Zesco requires the project company to build and finance the necessary upgrading and expansion of the Zesheke substation in order to connect the plant to the grid, according to the Grid Connection Agreement between the two parties. The work and equipment will be undertaken by the EPC contractor and transferred to Zesco&apos;s ownership after commissioning.</narrative>
  </description>
